{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/label_318.json","id":32939,"nhanesId":"","bundleName":"","fullName":"Only Protein Protein Powder Vanilla","brandName":"Only Protein","brandIpSymbol":"none","upcSku":"8 53830 00305 1","productVersionCode":"v-1","pdf":"","thumbnail":"","servingsPerContainer":"21","hasOuterCarton":false,"percentDvFootnote":"Not Present","labelRelationships":[],"contacts":[{"contactId":5939,"text":null,"types":["Manufacturer"],"contactDetails":{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/contact_2.json","id":5939,"name":"Only Protein","streetAddress":"","city":"Draper","state":"UT","country":"","zipCode":"84020","phoneNumber":"","email":"","webAddress":"www.onlyprotein.com"}}],"netContents":[{"order":1,"quantity":1.25,"unit":"lb","display":"1.25 lb"},{"order":2,"quantity":567,"unit":"Gram(s)","display":"567 Gram(s)"}],"physicalState":{"langualCode":"E0162","langualCodeDescription":"Powder"},"servingSizes":[{"order":1,"minQuantity":27,"maxQuantity":27,"minDailyServings":1,"maxDailyServings":1,"unit":"Gram(s)","notes":"1 round scoop","inSFB":true}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)","Gluten Free"],"productType":{"langualCode":"A1325","langualCodeDescription":"Other Combinations"},"statements":[{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"BALANCED NUTRITION\nIt is common knowledge that it takes good nutrition and exercise to maintain or lose weight. ONLY PROTEIN meal replacement is a unique formula that is designed to help you with balanced nutrition. ONLY PROTEIN meal replacement is a highly bio-available Tri-Protein protein with vitamins, minerals, enzymes, and fiber, everything your body needs to maintain and build lean muscle.  We have also added South Africa Hoodia, Carnatine, and Garcina Cambogia, which research has shown to support metabolism of fat loss and lean muscle synthesis.\nBREAKFAST IN A SCOOP\nBreakfast is the most important meal of the day and yet many skip it.  Research shows that skipping meals causes us to gain weight.  Eating breakfast gets the metabolism going for the day.  For those that feel there is no time, or are not breakfast eaters, ONLY PROTEIN is a great way to get your day started.  Grab a water bottle add a scoop, shake and you are ready.\nHIGH QUALITY INGREDIENTS\nWe only use the highest quality protein and ingredients in our products.  ONLY PROTEIN contains no fillers, hydrogenated oils, hydrolyzed protein, or artificial sweeteners like aspartame, acesulfame potassium (ace-K), and sucralose.  To maximize absorption we have added 200mg of Protease to ensure proper proetin metabolism and 200mg of Lactase for those that are lactose intolerant.  Cellulose free fiber has been added to help you meet your daily fiber needs.  ONLY PROTEIN contains branch chain amino acids, including Isoleucine, Leucine and Valine.\nHEALTHY AND CONVENIENT\nStart using ONLY PROTEIN meal replacement as part of your training program to get in shape.  It's also great before bedtime to strengthen and feed your muscles while you sleep.  It mixes easily, and it's delicious, low-sugar formula is excellent for any low carb diet."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"NO SOY\nNO GLUTEN\nNO PESTICIDES\nNO SUCRALOSE\nNO SUGAR ADDED\nNO SUGAR ALCOHOLS\nNO CHEMICAL ADDITIVES\nNO HYDROLIZED PROTEINS"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Made in the USA"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"JUST ADD TO 4-6 OZ OF WATER"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"100% All Natural New Zealand Whey"},{"type":"Formula re: Type","notes":"GLYCEMIC FRIENDLY"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"ZERO GMO"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"NO ARTIFICIAL SWEETENERS"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"NO HORMONES"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"For those on the Go!"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Cellulose-free fiber"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Manufactured in a GMP Certified Facility"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"GMP GOOD MANUFACTURING PRACTICE CONSISTENT QUALITY"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the FDA.  These products are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"ALLERGY WARNING - Contains: Milk By-Products"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"GLUTEN FREE"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"3G Glutamine"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Quick Muscle Feed"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"MIXES EASY AND TASTES GREAT!"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"v-1"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"(C) 2011 Only Protein\nAll Rights Reserved\n"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"18g Protein"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"21 Servings"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"GLUTEN FREE"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"4G BCAAs"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No Artificial Sweeteners"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Highly Bio-Available"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Whether you are using ONLY PROTEIN for your pre workout, post workout, or helping to protect muscle through the night, ONLY PROTEIN has been formulated for a quick muscle feed as well as the extended muscle feed.  We have also added cellulose free fiber to help with your daily fiber intake and to help you feel full.  Protease has been added to help with protein metabolism and Lactase for those who are lactose intolerant.  ONLY PROTEIN is a great way to start and finish your day, with low calories, carbohydrates and sugars."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Mix with 4-6 ounces of water.  Shake well until completely dissolved.\nJUST ADD TO WATER"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Grassfed"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"NO ANTIBIOTICS"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Cellulose-Free Fiber"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Unique Tri-Protein Blend"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Hormone/Antibiotic Free"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Tri-Protein for longer muscle feed"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No Artificial sweeteners"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Gluten and GMO free"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Amino Acid Profile\nEssential Amino Acids\nIsoleusine 1200 mg\nLeucine 1980 mg\nLysine 1760 mg\nMethionine 400 mg\nPhenylalanine 640 mg\nThreonine 1250 mg\nTryptophan 395 mg\nValine 1060 mg\nNon Essential Amino Acids\nHistidine 309 mg\nAlanine 978 mg\nArginine 543 mg\nAspartic Acid 2020 mg\nCysteine/Cystine 478 mg\nGlutamic Acid 3170 mg\nGlycine 369 mg\nProline 1100 mg\nSerine 884 mg\nTyrosine 614 mg"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2014-05-23","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ingredientRows":[{"order":1,"ingredientId":284519,"description":null,"notes":null,"quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":27,"operator":"=","quantity":105,"unit":"{Calories}","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"}],"nestedRows":[{"order":2,"ingredientId":284522,"description":null,"notes":"Calories (Form: from Fat) ","quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":27,"operator":"=","quantity":13,"unit":"{Calories}","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"}],"nestedRows":[],"name":"Calories from Fat","category":"other","ingredientGroup":"Calories","uniiCode":"1","alternateNames"